# Pipe + each-kv integration: three-stage pipeline
# Tests dict | each-kv | filter predicate | collect
# Filter for even values only
[a: 1  b: 2  c: 3  d: 4] | each-kv | [filter [fn [let pair] [call $= 0 [call $mod pair.value 2]]]] | collect
=== out
Dict({0: Dict({"key": String("b"), "value": Int(2)}), 1: Dict({"key": String("d"), "value": Int(4)})})
